    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To decrypt a ciphertext payload with a managed key, I will use the AWS KMS (Key Management Service) as the external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make it identifiable in the code. The AWS KMS service is widely used for managing cryptographic keys and performing encryption and decryption operations. </thinking>\n",
